  ('zcrm_5797994000002119109', 'Manta Biofuel', NULL, 'Zeynep Acun', 'Ryan Powell', 'Manta Biofuel produces cost-effective renewable fuel oil from algae. Manta has developed and patented a distributed magnetic harvesting system with the goal of decarbonizing our economy. They are currently targeting the $10B heating oil market, with the long-term goal of transitioning the international shipping market to carbon neutral liquidfuels.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2024', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zeynep Acun', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability,Needs Attention', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-01-18 16:17:04', '2025-03-21 08:16:32', '2025-03-21 08:16:32'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002119150', 'Kazadi Enterprises', NULL, 'Zeynep Acun', 'Sanza Kazadi', 'Kazadi Enterprises has developed a breakthrough technology allowing the use of environmental heat energy as an energy source. This technology has myriad uses. A first use is in the dehumidification space where it will reduce the energy footprint of dehumidification by up to 90%.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2024', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Zeynep Acun', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability,Needs Attention', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-01-18 16:25:25', '2025-03-21 08:16:22', '2025-03-21 08:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002119167', 'Tri Global Energy', NULL, 'Zeynep Acun', 'John Billingsley', 'Tri Global Energy is a utility-scale renewable energy developer drawing on the natural, renewable resources of the wind and the sun to successfully address the growing demand for clean and sustainable energy. The company is responsible for nearly one-quarter of all wind energy projects currently under construction in Texas, the nation’s leader in wind capacity. Recently, Tri Global Energy has emerged as a solar energy developer and provider, increasing the company’s renewable energy capacity.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Fall 2024', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Zeynep Acun', 'Rejected', 'Sustainability,Needs Attention', 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', NULL, '2025-01-18 16:29:13', '2025-03-21 08:16:53', '2025-03-21 08:16:53'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000002119212', 'Sports Engineering (SEI)', 'Sports Engineering', 'Isabella DeLeo', 'Andrew Simonds', 'Sports tech company that specializes in identifying, developing, and commercializing innovative and disruptive sports technologies. First company to introduce a unique sole design that protects against catastrophic knee and ankle injuries while maintaining performance. Revolutionary nonlinear tunable spring systems called "Smart SpringTM" – control load transmissions at the critical level when ordinary playing loads are exceeded and potential for injury increases.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Fall 2023', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Isabella DeLeo', 'Too Early', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2025-01-19 07:10:30', '2025-04-30 06:39:13', '2025-04-30 06:39:13'),
